<BRK/>
<TXT>Dispose burn combustible debris in accordance with paragraph DISPOSAL OF MATERIAL.  Dispose noncombustible debris 
in excess of that disposed of as set forth in paragraph STRUCTURES at such locations below elevation [_____] 
as designated by the Contracting Officer.  Debris includes trash of all kinds.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>MARKETABLE MATERIALS</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Any of the cleared materials which the Contractor considers marketable becomes its property and remove from the 
reservoir area.</TXT><BRK/>
